			"Message": "docs(Vine): Restructure CHANGELOG for clarity and accuracy\n\nRefactor the CHANGELOG entry structure to better communicate Vine's evolution:\n- Add introductory paragraph explaining Vine is the gRPC contract and where `Vine.proto` actually lives (in Mountain's tree)\n- Rename v2.1 from \"Q2 2026\" to \"Full Workbench Lift (April 2026)\" and convert from Changed to Added/Changed format with commit references\n- Simplify v2.0 from detailed RPC listings to \"Editor Launch\" with note about protocol stability through the window\n- Consolidate v1.2 and v1.1 into a single \"Pre-Documentation Scaffold\" section noting Vine existed as a placeholder\n- Add new v0.0 section documenting the original 2025 repository creation\n\nThese changes provide a more accurate historical record while removing verbose RPC listings better suited for protocol reference docs.",
			"SHA": "e2dc32a183e523e2d393553319db40a3b8aebad3"
		},
