			],
			"Message": "fix(Vine): Correct GitHub URLs in README documentation\n\nFix broken and incorrect links in the Vine README:\n- Update license link from Vine repo path to correct Land repo path\n- Point proto file references to their actual locations in Mountain and Grove repositories\n- Fix Spine Contract link at the bottom of the README\n\nThese corrections ensure the documentation links actually navigate to the correct resources.",
